      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.01,
      "end_seconds": 272.7,
      "duration_seconds": 12.69,
      "text": "that's the examination finished from what you've told me and what I found, I don't have a clear answer today: possible white-coat blood pressure is possible, and so is early hypertension"
