      "start_seconds": 277.09,
      "end_seconds": 300.95,
      "duration_seconds": 23.86,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like possible white-coat blood pressure, but I'd like to confirm. Let's book a 24-hour blood pressure monitor to look into raised clinic blood pressure. Cut back on salt and do a week of home readings. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse."
